From: Isaac Forge <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Link targets instead of ament_target_dependencies()

ament_target_dependencies() was removed from ament_cmake in 2.8.6 (ament/ament_cmake#614),
so this no longer configures on ROS 2 Lyrical. Link each dependency's exported
${<pkg>_TARGETS} instead, as nvblox_ros already does. Plain signature, matching the
other target_link_libraries() calls on these targets.
---
--- a/isaac_ros_vda5050_client/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/isaac_ros_vda5050_client/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -90,9 +90,9 @@
   ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include
 )
 target_compile_definitions(example_action_handler PUBLIC "PLUGINLIB__DISABLE_BOOST_FUNCTIONS")
-ament_target_dependencies(example_action_handler
-  ${example_handler_dependencies}
-)
+foreach(_dep IN LISTS example_handler_dependencies)
+  target_link_libraries(example_action_handler ${${_dep}_TARGETS})
+endforeach()
 
 install(TARGETS vda5050_client_node example_action_handler
   ARCHIVE DESTINATION lib
